    "expect": {
      "exit_status": 0,
      "temp_empty": true
    },
    "note": "Decisive R2 structural reproducer (Del join): shorten the final remainder to ' fff' (3 bytes) so 3 + 7 (eee ddd) = 10 <= fill 12, making marker validity determine acceptance. The reference does not restore the spillage pointer when undoing the Delete-join (undo JOIN creates a new node), so the subsequent wrap must split (fff above eee ddd), not join into 'fff eee ddd'."
